        "message": "ci(smoke): RANKINGS_ENABLED=true at the smoke JOB level — the prerender bakes the flag\n\nThe webServer env alone was insufficient: the smoke job's BUILD step (no\nflag) prerendered the homepage with rankings off, and ISR serves that\nprerender on the first hit — the runtime flag only surfaces after\nrevalidation. CI proved it: Top Buy test failed again with the same\n'disabled panel' DOM. Setting the flag at the job level makes the build\nbake the ENABLED path the smoke suite pins.",
